    <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto w-full space-y-8 pt-8">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="border-b border-neutral-900 pb-4">
            <h1 class="text-sm tracking-[0.3em] text-white font-bold uppercase">ARCHIVE // ABOUT EDITOR</h1>
            <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 mt-1">Structure section metadata, scale paragraph fields, and compile components.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Metadata Inputs -->
        <div class="space-y-4 bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-neutral-900 p-6">
            <!-- Title Input -->
            <div class="space-y-2">
                <label class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-400 font-semibold flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i data-lucide="type" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i> Section Title
                </label>
                <input type="text" id="sectionTitle" value="About the Project" 
                    class="w-full bg-[#050505] border border-neutral-900 p-3 text-xs text-neutral-200 rounded-none transition-colors duration-200">
            </div>

            <!-- Paragraph Count Control -->
            <div class="pt-2 flex items-center justify-between">
                <label class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-400 font-semibold flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i data-lucide="layers" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i> Paragraph Blocks
                </label>
                <div class="flex gap-2">
                    <button onclick="adjustParagraphs(-1)" class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 hover:bg-neutral-800 text-xs text-white border border-neutral-800 rounded-none transition-colors">- Remove</button>
                    <button onclick="adjustParagraphs(1)" class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 hover:bg-neutral-800 text-xs text-white border border-neutral-800 rounded-none transition-colors">+ Add Paragraph</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Dynamic Paragraph Fields Container -->
            <div id="paragraphContainer" class="space-y-4 pt-2">
                <!-- Initial Paragraphs (Populated with your current text) -->
                <div class="space-y-1.5 p-box">
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-neutral-600 uppercase tracking-wider block">Paragraph 1</span>
                    <textarea class="paragraph-input w-full h-24 bg-[#050505] border border-neutral-900 p-3 text-xs text-neutral-300 rounded-none resize-none transition-colors duration-200">This project is a personal soundboard built from poetry, observation, and lived thought. Each release functions less like a single song and more like a captured moment of reflection—where ideas about society, identity, attention, and behaviour are translated into sound. It is not driven by trend or genre convention, but by themes and questions, using music as a way to document inner dialogue in a public space. The body of work sits under Warratyi at Warratyi Black Label as an evolving archive of emotional and conceptual sketches.</textarea>
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-1.5 p-box">
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-neutral-600 uppercase tracking-wider block">Paragraph 2</span>
                    <textarea class="paragraph-input w-full h-24 bg-[#050505] border border-neutral-900 p-3 text-xs text-neutral-300 rounded-none resize-none transition-colors duration-200">The way the music is made comes from writing first, not production. Ideas are formed as text, spoken rhythm, or poetic structure, then shaped into musical form through atmosphere, pacing, and tone. Production follows the meaning rather than leading it—piano, voice, distortion, and space are chosen to match the emotional weight of the words. Each track is built like a scene or statement, layered gradually until the feeling of the idea is fully translated into sound.</textarea>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Compile Button -->
        <button onclick="compileAboutSection()" 
            class="w-full py-3 bg-white text-black text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-colors duration-200 rounded-none flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
            <i data-lucide="file-code" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i> Compile & Build Output
        </button>

        <!-- Output Block -->
        <div id="outputWrapper" class="space-y-8 hidden">
            <!-- Clean HTML Display -->
            <div class="space-y-2">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                    <label class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-400 font-semibold flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i data-lucide="terminal" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i> Compiled Layout Code
                    </label>
                    <button onclick="copyCode()" class="text-xs text-neutral-500 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-100 flex items-center gap-1">
                        <i data-lucide="copy" class="w-3 h-3"></i> <span id="copyText">Copy Code</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
                <textarea id="htmlOutput" readonly 
                    class="w-full h-48 bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-neutral-900 p-4 text-xs text-emerald-500/90 rounded-none resize-none cursor-text"></textarea>
